==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|tenax|tenāx|holding fast, clinging|lang=la}}, from {{term|tenere|tenēre|to hold|lang=la}} {{suffix||ious}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/təˈneɪʃəs/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/t@"neIS@s/}}
*: {{rhymes|eɪʃəs}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[clinging]] to an [[object]] or [[surface]]; [[adhesive]]
# [[unwilling]] to [[yield]] or [[give up]]; [[dogged]]
# [[holding]] [[together]]; [[cohesive]]
# having a good [[memory]]; [[retentive]]

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:obstinate]]

